@startsalt pickup-inspection
{+
    <b>CAR RENTAL | Agency employee
    --
    <b>Pick up car - Joint inspection
    RES-001 - Alex Martin - AB-123-CD
    .
    {^"Car condition"
        Inspect the car together with the customer.
        (X) No damage found | () Damage found
        Observations | "No visible damage.                    "
        . | "                                      "
    }
    .
    {^"Customer digital signature"
        I confirm the car condition recorded above.
        {+
            .
            Alex Martin - sign here
            .
        }
        [Clear signature]
    }
    .
    Record both the evaluation and the customer's signature.
    Changes to the evaluation require a new signature.
    --
    [ [[latex://fig:lofi-ui-driving-licence Back]] ] | [ [[latex://fig:lofi-ui-payment Save inspection and continue]] ]
}
@endsalt
